/Title (10. Conclusion The B&J Biscuit Sales Dashboard converts raw sales data into meaningful business insights. It allows users to monitor KPIs, analyze customer behavior, compare revenue across different categories, and identify profitable business opportunities. The interactive dashboard helps management make quick and informed decisions, improving overall business performance.)
